{
  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1759927001_1769756_c8a426075b139626ebfc09c0aede1735.png",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><h2 data-start=\"207\" data-end=\"286\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\" id=\"isPasted\">🌿<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>Polybalm: The Clinically Proven Nail Care Solution That Changes Lives</h2><p data-start=\"288\" data-end=\"785\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><strong data-start=\"288\" data-end=\"300\">Polybalm</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>is a 100% natural, dermatologist- and oncologist-developed nail balm clinically proven to<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><strong data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"433\">protect, strengthen, and restore nails</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>damaged by harsh treatments, environmental stress, and daily wear. Originally formulated by a team of<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><strong data-start=\"536\" data-end=\"602\">oncologists, dermatologists, and botanical experts in the U.K.</strong>, Polybalm has been shown in a<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><em data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"684\">published double-blind, randomized clinical trial</em><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>to dramatically reduce nail loss and brittleness — especially in patients undergoing chemotherapy.</p><h3 data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"829\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">💅<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>What Makes Polybalm Exceptional</h3><ul data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"1755\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><li data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"949\"><p data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"949\"><strong data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"854\">Clinically Proven:</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>Backed by peer-reviewed clinical research demonstrating real protection against nail damage.</p></li><li data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"1216\"><p data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"1216\"><strong data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"977\">100% Natural Formula:</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>Made with a nourishing blend of<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><strong data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1117\">olive oil, shea butter, cocoa butter, beeswax, eucalyptus, lavender, wintergreen, and African wild sage</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>— ingredients known for their anti-inflammatory, antimicrobial, and deeply hydrating properties.</p></li><li data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1410\"><p data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1410\"><strong data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1255\">Designed for Sensitive Patients:</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>Free from parabens, silicones, and synthetic fragrances — gentle enough for patients receiving medical treatments, yet powerful enough for everyday use.</p></li><li data-start=\"1411\" data-end=\"1567\"><p data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1567\"><strong data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1433\">Visible Results:</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>Helps maintain nail strength, reduces brittleness, splitting, and peeling, and restores a healthy appearance to nails and cuticles.</p></li><li data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1755\"><p data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1755\"><strong data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1584\">Multi-Use:</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>Effective for both fingernails and toenails. Ideal for those recovering from chemotherapy, frequent salon manicures, gel or acrylic damage, or occupational nail stress.</p></li></ul><h3 data-start=\"1757\" data-end=\"1795\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">🌸<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>How Polybalm Helps Patients</h3><ul data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"2310\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><li data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1933\"><p data-start=\"1798\" data-end=\"1933\"><strong data-start=\"1798\" data-end=\"1820\">Oncology patients:</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>Helps prevent and repair painful nail damage from taxane-based chemotherapy, restoring comfort and confidence.</p></li><li data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"2031\"><p data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"2031\"><strong data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"1961\">Dermatology patients:</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>Supports nail recovery from eczema, psoriasis, and chronic dryness.</p></li><li data-start=\"2032\" data-end=\"2176\"><p data-start=\"2034\" data-end=\"2176\"><strong data-start=\"2034\" data-end=\"2061\">General wellness users:</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>Provides everyday protection for nails exposed to frequent washing, chemical exposure, or professional handwork.</p></li><li data-start=\"2177\" data-end=\"2310\"><p data-start=\"2179\" data-end=\"2310\"><strong data-start=\"2179\" data-end=\"2200\">Emotional impact:</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>Re-empowers patients — helping them feel “normal,” confident, and beautiful again during and after treatment.</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"2312\" data-end=\"2315\" style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><h2 data-start=\"2317\" data-end=\"2365\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">💼<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>Affiliate &amp; Representative Opportunity</h2><p data-start=\"2367\" data-end=\"2545\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">Polybalm’s mission is simple:<spa