-care companion.</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2868\" data-end=\"3023\"><td data-start=\"2868\" data-end=\"2917\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"2870\" data-end=\"2916\">Infusion Centers &amp; Cancer Support Programs</strong></td><td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"2917\" data-end=\"3023\">Nurses and patient navigators can recommend Polybalm to help improve patient comfort and satisfaction.</td></tr><tr data-start=\"3024\" data-end=\"3177\"><td data-start=\"3024\" data-end=\"3064\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"3026\" data-end=\"3063\">Dermatology &amp; Aesthetic Practices</strong></td><td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"3064\" data-end=\"3177\">Perfect retail add-on for patients dealing with brittle nails from age/menopause, eczema, psoriasis, or chemical irritation.</td></tr><tr data-start=\"3178\" data-end=\"3289\"><td data-start=\"3178\" data-end=\"3203\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"3180\" data-end=\"3202\">Nail Salons &amp; Spas</strong></td><td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"3203\" data-end=\"3289\">Ideal for post-manicure repair, natural nail care, and salon-safe retail displays.</td></tr><tr data-start=\"3290\" data-end=\"3392\"><td data-start=\"3290\" data-end=\"3315\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"3292\" data-end=\"3314\">Medical &amp; Day Spas</strong></td><td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"3315\" data-end=\"3392\">A premium, all-natural upsell in wellness and beauty recovery treatments.</td></tr><tr data-start=\"3393\" data-end=\"3518\"><td data-start=\"3393\" data-end=\"3437\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"3395\" data-end=\"3436\">Wellness Boutiques &amp; Holistic Centers</strong></td><td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"3437\" data-end=\"3518\">Appeals to clients who value natural, plant-based products backed by science.</td></tr><tr data-start=\"3519\" data-end=\"3630\"><td data-start=\"3519\" data-end=\"3558\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"3521\" data-end=\"3557\">Pharmacies &amp; Integrative Clinics</strong></td><td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"3558\" data-end=\"3630\">Over-the-counter retail opportunity with strong clinical validation.</td></tr><tr data-start=\"3631\" data-end=\"3791\"><td data-start=\"3631\" data-end=\"3675\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"3633\" data-end=\"3674\">Online Health Advocates &amp; Influencers</strong></td><td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"3675\" data-end=\"3791\">Earn commissions through educational videos, blogs, or social posts — while helping others feel confident again.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><hr data-start=\"3793\" data-end=\"3796\" style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><h3 data-start=\"3798\" data-end=\"3826\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">💰<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>Earning Potential</h3><ul data-start=\"3827\" data-end=\"4089\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><li data-start=\"3827\" data-end=\"3873\"><p data-start=\"3829\" data-end=\"3873\">Competitive commission rates on every sale</p></li><li data-start=\"3874\" data-end=\"3952\"><p data-start=\"3876\" data-end=\"3952\">Bonus tiers for volume or specialty channels (medical, s